alwaysApply: true
---

See AGENTS.md in the repository root for the full reference covering architecture, the customization system, tool authoring patterns, testing, and coding conventions.

Key rules:
- Never modify files in src/okta_mcp_server/ — all changes go in customizations/ and are declared in customizations/manifest.yaml
- Run the server with: uv run python custom_server.py
- Decorator order on tools: @mcp.tool() → @require_scopes() → @validate_ids()
- Every new tool that needs scope enforcement must be added to TOOL_SCOPE_REGISTRY in src/okta_mcp_server/utils/scope_registry.py
- Run before committing: uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format .
